<title>SRI LANKA: SRI LANKA V PAKISTAN 2ND TEST SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>SRI LANKA V PAKISTAN 2ND TEST SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the first day of</p>
<p>the second and final test between Sri Lanka and Pakistan on</p>
<p>Saturay:</p>
